{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>俄羅斯衛星通訊社報道，俄羅斯總統普京與美國總統特朗普周四（19日）在深圳出席亞太經合組織（APEC）會議期間舉行雙邊會晤。特朗普稱普京為朋友，並表示很高興見到他。（衛星通訊社）</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T05:24:04.156544+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":88,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T04:38:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T21:38:07.188553+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T05:17:25.806860+00:00","content_hash":"0ad948dbac9bb5f2ffb7eb030e543cfb204317748270ab60eb68bf447bc3f1a4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}